{"title":"BIM技术,助力广州地铁精准建设","date":"2017-07-12","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#404040;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt\">BIM</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#404040;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt\">技术<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>助力广州地铁精准建设<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:宋体\">来源：新快报<em><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-style: normal;\"><o:p></o:p></span></em></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\">BIM</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\ncolor:#404040\">的全称是<span lang=\"EN-US\">BuildingInformation Modeling,</span>即建筑信息模型<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>它是以三维数字技术为基础<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>集成建筑工程项目各种相关信息的工程数据模型<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>是一种应用于建筑工程设计、建造、管理全过程的数字集成方法。而广州地铁在国内轨道交通行业<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术应用方面正处于先进水平<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>目前<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>这项先进的技术已在广州地铁六号线二期和七号线工程建设中率先广泛使用<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>利用<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>使广州地铁的建设更加精准可靠<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>全方位实现了建筑工业化。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\ncolor:#404040\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><b style=\"line-height: 24pt; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">虚拟建模<span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span>施工全程<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>可视化<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span></span></b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\">通俗来说<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>应用<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>就是在施工之前利用三维建筑模型来模拟施工过程<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>以方便施工单位更精细地施工<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>让工程管理不会忽视任何一个细节。</span></b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt 160px; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201707/1.jpg\" style=\"width: 510px; height: 306px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt 240px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<em style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 26px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-style: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">六号线二期<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>车站吊挂式综合管线槽施工<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>三维模型</span></em></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 24pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">广州地铁六号线二期和七号线工程率先广泛使用了该项技术。相关技术人员介绍</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">:&ldquo;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">利用三维模型进行虚拟建造</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">同一座车站</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">我们要造两次</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">第一次在电脑里</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">第二次是在我们的现实世界里。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">&rdquo;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">据了解</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">相较于以往的工程技术</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,<b>BIM</b></span><b style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">技术最显著的优势就是<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>可视化<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">即你看到的模型是什么样的</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">最后做出来的实际效果就是什么样的。</span><b style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>可视化<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>的优势非常明显<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>无论是现场效果模拟<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>还是施工进度模拟<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>都可以做到非常精确</b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">此外</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">设计与施工的协调在实际施工前就进行的模拟</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">,</span><b style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt; text-indent: 24pt;\">可以使问题在施工前就提前暴露<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>加强施工管理<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>这些优势都可以让建设资源、安全、质量、进度、档案资料等各项要素的精细化管理变得更加直观、高效。</b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\">同时<span lang=\"EN-US\">,BIM</span>技术还可将模型的构件与相应的工艺工法相关联<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>并录制成虚拟建造的可视化交底视频<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>施工单位使用视频对施工班组进行培训<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>工艺标准更加直观形象<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>更易于被工人理解<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>增强技术交底的实效。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt 160px; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201707/2.jpg\" style=\"width: 510px; height: 406px;\" /></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 360px;\">\r\n\t<em><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-style: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">利用<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术建模的站厅效果图</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 24pt; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">超前处理<span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span>大幅减少整改返工</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\">据广州地铁介绍<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>在以往的地铁施工中<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>很多<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>躲藏<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>在施工组织计划中的问题要到工地现场施工的时候才被发现<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>这往往会造成整改返工<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>严重制约施工进度。而现在各专业的施工组织计划都在计算机里通过<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM&ldquo;</span>演练<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>一遍<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>哪里的施工空间没有被利用起来<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>哪个作业面有两个专业在<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>打架<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;,</span>哪里的管线碰撞到一起<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>哪里会阻碍设备的运输<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>所有问题都能在电脑里<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>一览无遗<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>。然后<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>再对设计图纸进行纠偏、纠错及优化<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><b>实现设计少错化、无错化<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>解决机电与建筑结构之间的碰撞问题。</b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\">因此<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><b>应用了<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术后<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>所有现场实施的方案都是经过模拟的<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>最佳实践<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;,</span>施工人员、设备材料、工器具、作业空间等资源都得以精准配置到每一道工序<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>大大减少了整改返工的现象。</b>以<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>车站吊挂式综合管线槽施工<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>为例<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>该施工需在机电风管安装完成后进行<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>加之经常与风水电管槽冲突导致整改返工<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>按照传统思路去做的话<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>施工进度很受影响。应用<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术后<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>将弱电综合线槽与机电风水电管槽模型进行合并建模<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>直观、精准地呈现施工工序<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>找出并解决交叉工序和专业的碰撞问题<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>减少了整改返工<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>有效加快施工进度。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">多元应用<span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span>优势体现在方方面面</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;color:#404040\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\">在六号线二期、七号线的施工过程中<span lang=\"EN-US\">,BIM</span>技术应用非常广泛<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>达到了预期的效果。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\">运用<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>对优化设计与施工组织的效果非常明显。</span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\">在七号线鹤庄站<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>项目管理人员结合工期节点、工程特点、工艺要求、资源调度等信息<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>编制全过程的施工组织设计<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>其后将其与模型关联<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>进行虚拟建造<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>形成具备实操性的总体施工组织设计。通过应用<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>将施工蓝图转化为三维模型进行图纸会审<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>应用相对成熟的管线碰撞检测、漫游检查逻辑规则等功能<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>在施工正式开展前<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>对设计图纸进行纠偏、纠错及优化<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>实现设计少错化、无错化<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>使得鹤庄站能在重重包围的<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>大基坑<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>作业环境中突出重围<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>确保工程顺利推进。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\">机电施工工期紧张、专业繁多<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>如何实现施工资源的精准投放一直是困扰广州地铁的难题。但在六号线二期、七号线一期的机电工程施工中<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>这一难题<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>迎刃而解<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>。广州地铁通过<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>派工单<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;,</span>有效地化解了矛盾<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>派工单是连接虚拟与现实的桥梁<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>将数字模型与施工计划、各项资源<span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span>包括作业人员、作业空间、设备材料、工器具等<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span>、质量要求、安全风险及防控措施、档案资料等要素关联起来<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>在系统中进行虚拟建造<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>优化确认后形成派工单。施工单位严格按照派工单<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>精确定位作业地点<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>配置人员、设备材料、工器具等资源<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>并按照质量、安全要求进行施工。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;color:#404040\">在<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术的支持下<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>两条新线还实现了全专业的工艺工法统一。新线利用<span lang=\"EN-US\">BIM</span>技术提高施工管控水平<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>对工艺工法进行可视化展现<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>监理方根据可视化模型对工艺工法关键要点结合传统设计安装大样图纸进行审查<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>并对工艺工法样板模型进行验收。通过系统整合<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>统筹安排各专业施工工序<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>使工法工序衔接更加合理高效<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>同时<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>建立对现场施工人员工艺工法水平的考评机制<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>形成管理闭环<span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span>达到严格管理、优质施工的良好效果。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 24pt 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 24pt; font-stretch: normal; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}